  offer:
  - The archive is rebuilding parts of the campus out of alignment. Recover the reference
    record at Cussonia Court and bring it back for verification.
  - The reference station holds a stable record. Bring it back here and I will issue
    your next weapon. You can avoid the Residues along the route.
