  - Recover the reference record at Cussonia Court, then return here for verification
    and your weapon. You can avoid the Residues along the route.
  readyToTurnIn:
  - You have the record. Submit it for verification and collect your weapon.
  completed:
  - I've checked the Cussonia Court record. The archive is rebuilding several versions
    of the same place at once. Bring me the System Garden Tower record so we can
    compare them.
